gexcc's wasm32 backend instead: ffi_call in plain C through generated
trampolines (libffi-wasm32/ffi.c, and tramp.inc from libffi-wasm32/gen.py),
with closures of its own (ffi.c's ffi_closure_alloc; closures.c's allocator
wants executable memory, so it is left out on wasm).

